          {
            "title": "Question: Variables",
            "id": 105029,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was verwenden wir, um die Variable <code>name</code> mit einem String-Literal zu kombinieren?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Die <code>${name}</code> Syntax</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Die <code>$(name)</code> Syntax</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Die <code>$[name]</code> Syntax</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Die <code>${name}</code> Syntax.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Eine Begrüßung verwendet <code>`Welcome, ${name}!`</code>. Welcher Teil fügt den in <code>name</code> gespeicherten Wert ein?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>${name}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>$(name)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>$[name]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>${name}</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Expressions",
            "id": 105031,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist falsch an dem folgenden Code?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bananas = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" oranges = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fruits = \" /><text value=\"`Fruits : $(bananas + oranges)`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fruits);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Fruits : $(bananas + oranges)\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Die Syntax <code>$()</code> sollte geschweifte Klammern <code>{}</code> haben</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Die Syntax <code>$()</code> sollte Klammern <code>[]</code> haben</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Es gibt nichts falsch</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Die Syntax <code>$()</code> sollte geschweifte Klammern <code>{}</code> haben.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Das Template Literal verwendet <code>$(bananas + oranges)</code>. Was wird in den ausgegebenen Text aufgenommen?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bananas = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" oranges = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fruits = \" /><text value=\"`Fruits : $(bananas + oranges)`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fruits);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Fruits : $(bananas + oranges)\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Die Zeichen <code>$(bananas + oranges)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Die Summe <code>30</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ein JavaScript-Syntaxfehler</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Die Zeichen <code>$(bananas + oranges)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Variables",
            "id": 105042,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kombiniere das String-Literal <code>soccer</code> innerhalb der Variable <code>eventName</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" game = \" /><text value=\"`soccer`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" eventName = \" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\"${game}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" tournament`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(eventName);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"soccer tournament\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>$</code>, gefolgt von <code>{</code> und schließlich <code>game</code>, <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib <code>soccer tournament</code> aus, indem du den Wert von <code>game</code> in das Template Literal einfügst.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" game = \" /><text value=\"`soccer`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" eventName = \" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\"${game}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" tournament`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(eventName);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"$(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{game}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"eventName\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"match\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"soccer tournament\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>${</code>, gefolgt von <code>game</code>, <code>}</code> und schließlich <code>tournament</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Expressions",
            "id": 105044,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code, um die Anzahl der Fans in einem Fußballstadion anzuzeigen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" normalSeats = \" /><text value=\"32100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" vipSeats = \" /><text value=\"450\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fans = \" /><text value=\"`Fans : \" /><text value=\"${normalSeats + vipSeats}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fans);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Fans : 32550\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>$</code>, gefolgt von <code>{</code> und schließlich <code>+</code>, <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib die Gesamtzahl der Fans, <code>Fans : 32550</code>, aus, indem du die beiden Sitzplatzanzahlen im Template Literal auswertest.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" normalSeats = \" /><text value=\"32100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" vipSeats = \" /><text value=\"450\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fans = \" /><text value=\"`Fans : \" /><text value=\"${normalSeats + vipSeats}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fans);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"$(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"normalSeats\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Fans : 32550\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>vipSeats</code>, gefolgt von <code>${</code>, <code>+</code> und schließlich <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Functions",
            "id": 105035,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rufe die <code>getTeam</code>-Funktion auf und übergebe den String-Literal <code>Messi</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getTeam = \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" team = \" /><text value=\"`PSG`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"'s team is \" /><text value=\"${team}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\".`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getTeam\" /><text value=\"`Messi`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Messi&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'Messi'\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Messi's team is PSG.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>getTeam</code>, gefolgt von <code>`Messi`</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verwende den direkten Aufruf mit Backticks ohne Klammern, um <code>Messi's team is PSG.</code> anzuzeigen.</p><p>Vervollständige den zurückgegebenen Text mit dem gespeicherten Teamwert.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getTeam = \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" team = \" /><text value=\"`PSG`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"'s team is \" /><text value=\"${team}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\".`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getTeam\" /><text value=\"`Messi`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"getTeam(&quot;Messi&quot;)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Messi&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Messi's team is PSG.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>team</code>, gefolgt von <code>getTeam</code> und schließlich <code>`Messi`</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Basic Array Destructuring",
            "id": 121623,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ist <code>\"Nissan\"</code> eines der Elemente, die aus diesem Array destrukturiert wurden?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" [firstCar, secondCar, thirdCard, fourthCar, fifthCar,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" sixthCar\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"] = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Honda&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Volkswagen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bentley&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Cadillac&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Toyota&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chevrolet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nissan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(firstCar);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(secondCar);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(thirdCard);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fourthCar);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fifthCar);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(sixthCar);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Honda\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Volkswagen\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Bentley\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Cadillac\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Toyota\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Chevrolet\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nein</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ja</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle Nein aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Du fügst <code>seventhCar</code> nach <code>sixthCar</code> in das Muster ein und gibst es aus. Was zeigt die zusätzliche Ausgabe?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" [firstCar, secondCar, thirdCard, fourthCar, fifthCar,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" sixthCar\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"] = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Honda&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Volkswagen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bentley&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Cadillac&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Toyota&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chevrolet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nissan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(firstCar);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(secondCar);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(thirdCard);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fourthCar);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fifthCar);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(sixthCar);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Honda\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Volkswagen\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Bentley\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Cadillac\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Toyota\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Chevrolet\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">\"Nissan\"</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">\"Chevrolet\"</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">undefined</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle \"Nissan\" aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Default values in Arrays",
            "id": 122162,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was wird <code>console.log(favoriteFruit)</code> ausgeben?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" [id, userName, favoriteFruit = \" /><text value=\"'Apple'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] = [\" /><text value=\"'0015'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Ben Anderson'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Orange'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(id);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(userName);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(favoriteFruit);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0015\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Ben Anderson\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Orange\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Orange</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Apfel</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle Orange aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Du entfernst <code>'Orange'</code> aus dem Array, sodass zwei Elemente bleiben. Was zeigt die letzte Ausgabe nun?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" [id, userName, favoriteFruit = \" /><text value=\"'Apple'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] = [\" /><text value=\"'0015'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'Ben Anderson'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'Orange'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(id);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(userName);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(favoriteFruit);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"0015\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Ben Anderson\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Orange\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Apfel, weil für den fehlenden dritten Wert der Standardwert verwendet wird.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Orange, weil der vorherige dritte Wert erhalten bleibt.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">undefined, weil das Array keinen dritten Wert hat.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Apfel, weil für den fehlenden dritten Wert der Standardwert verwendet wird.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Assign the Rest in Arrays",
            "id": 121624,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Destrukturiere die ersten beiden Elemente dieses Arrays und behalte die verbleibenden Elemente in der Variable <code>otherCars</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" [firstCar, secondCard, ...otherCars] = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Honda&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Volkswagen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bentley&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Cadillac&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Toyota&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chevrolet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nissan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Kia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(firstCar);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(secondCard);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(otherCars);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"41\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Honda\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Volkswagen\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"[ 'Bentley', 'Cadillac', 'Toyota', 'Chevrolet', 'Nissan', 'Kia' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>...otherCars</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Basic Object Destructuring",
            "id": 121619,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Destrukturiere das Objekt <code>animal</code> und füge beide Variablen in das <code>console.log</code> ein.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" animal = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pet\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"'cat'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"age\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" pet,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age,\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} = animal;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Hi friends! I'm a \" /><text value=\"${pet}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" and I am \" /><text value=\"${age}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" years old.`\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"125\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hi friends! I'm a cat and I am 3 years old.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>pet</code>, gefolgt von <code>age</code> und schließlich <code>pet</code>, <code>age</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
